OL,3,GNEWSANew GP contract deal a 'start' but
OL,4,Amore funding needed, BMA warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new contract with GPs, accompanied by
OL,7,Fan extra #40m investment, will make it
OL,8,F"easier" to get a doctor's appointment,
OL,9,FNorthern Ireland's health minister has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FRobbie Butler has secured an agreement
OL,13,Fwith GPs more than a year after family
OL,14,Fdoctors withdrew some services in
OL,15,Fprotest over a lack of adequate
OL,16,Ffunding.
OL,18,FDr Frances O'Hagan from the British
OL,19,FMedical Association (BMA) said the #40m
OL,20,Fwould be used to hire more GPs and
OL,21,Freceptionists to increase capacity in
OL,22,Fsurgeries.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
