OL,3,GNEWSANew GP contract deal a 'start' but
OL,4,Amore funding needed, BMA warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, she said the investment was
OL,7,Fonly "a start" and was "by no means all
OL,8,Fthat we need" in order to address all
OL,9,Fof the demands that GPs are facing.
